From 6f464f5f94547577ee5a63d2346d25abaf6a2a89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: redducc <sushmit718@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 11:44:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Restore AOSP's shade to QS hand-off for the default
 style

The late QS fade suits the styles whose QS matches QQS; in the default style the QQS tiles sat frozen until it.
---
 .../systemui/scene/ui/composable/SceneContainer.kt  |  7 +++++++
 .../ui/composable/SceneContainerTransitions.kt      |  7 +++++--
 .../composable/SceneContainerTransitionsBuilder.kt  |  2 ++
 .../FromShadeToQuickSettingsTransition.kt           | 13 ++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/compose/features/src/com/android/systemui/scene/ui/composable/SceneContainer.kt b/packages/SystemUI/compose/features/src/com/android/systemui/scene/ui/composable/SceneContainer.kt
